From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:02:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] nm-sim: NM implies SIM-NME' under CPA (PS10 Theorem
 174.8, PSV07 Theorem 3)

Prove FixedLengthPKScheme.simNMSecure_of_nmSecure_cpa; Theorem 174.8 under
CPA is admission-free. New helper modules: Rounds (round readers, one-call
lemmas, one-shot cost bound), Challenge (the challenge handler shared by the
simulator and the NM adversary), Simulator (ideal = H_true), Reduction (the NM
adversary), Recover (the NM distinguisher), IndSim (NM_b = H_b). Hybrid gains
the history oracle, block lemmas and the hybrid acceptance rate.
